Task 1: Write Ansible Playbooks to Automate User and Group Creation
Subtask 1.1: Set Up Ansible Environment for IdM
First, we'll configure the Ansible control node to communicate with the IdM server.

Connect to the Ansible control node:
ssh student@ansible-control
Install the required Ansible collections for IdM:
ansible-galaxy collection install freeipa.ansible_freeipa
Create the project directory structure:
mkdir -p ~/idm-automation/{playbooks,inventory,group_vars}
cd ~/idm-automation
Create the inventory file:
cat > inventory/hosts << 'EOF'
[idm_servers]
idm-server ansible_host=idm-server.example.com

[idm_servers:vars]
ansible_user=admin
ansible_ssh_private_key_file=~/.ssh/id_rsa
EOF
Subtask 1.2: Configure IdM Authentication for Ansible
Create group variables for IdM authentication:
cat > group_vars/idm_servers.yml << 'EOF'
---
ipaadmin_principal: admin
ipaadmin_password: "{{ vault_idm_admin_password }}"
ipaserver_domain: example.com
ipaserver_realm: EXAMPLE.COM
EOF
Create an encrypted vault file for sensitive data:
ansible-vault create group_vars/vault.yml
When prompted, enter a vault password and add the following content: ```yaml
vault_idm_admin_password: "YourIdMAdminPassword"


### Subtask 1.3: Create User Management Playbook

1. **Create a comprehensive user management playbook**:
```bash
cat > playbooks/manage_users.yml << 'EOF'
---
- name: Manage IdM Users
  hosts: idm_servers
  become: no
  gather_facts: no
  
  vars:
    users_to_create:
      - name: john.doe
        first: John
        last: Doe
        email: john.doe@example.com
        password: TempPassword123!
        groups:
          - developers
          - project_alpha
      - name: jane.smith
        first: Jane
        last: Smith
        email: jane.smith@example.com
        password: TempPassword456!
        groups:
          - administrators
          - project_beta
      - name: bob.wilson
        first: Bob
        last: Wilson
        email: bob.wilson@example.com
        password: TempPassword789!
        groups:
          - developers
          - project_alpha

  tasks:
    - name: Ensure users are present in IdM
      freeipa.ansible_freeipa.ipauser:
        ipaadmin_principal: "{{ ipaadmin_principal }}"
        ipaadmin_password: "{{ ipaadmin_password }}"
        name: "{{ item.name }}"
        first: "{{ item.first }}"
        last: "{{ item.last }}"
        email: "{{ item.email }}"
        password: "{{ item.password }}"
        update_password: on_create
        state: present
      loop: "{{ users_to_create }}"
      no_log: true

    - name: Force password change on first login
      freeipa.ansible_freeipa.ipauser:
        ipaadmin_principal: "{{ ipaadmin_principal }}"
        ipaadmin_password: "{{ ipaadmin_password }}"
        name: "{{ item.name }}"
        password_expiration: "20231201000000Z"
        state: present
      loop: "{{ users_to_create }}"
EOF
