Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Authentication Failures
Problem: Ansible cannot authenticate with IdM server

Solution:

# Verify IdM admin credentials
kinit admin
klist

# Check if IdM server is accessible
ping idm-server.example.com

# Verify SSH connectivity
ssh admin@idm-server.example.com
Issue 2: Module Not Found Errors
Problem: freeipa.ansible_freeipa modules not found

Solution:

# Reinstall the collection
ansible-galaxy collection install freeipa.ansible_freeipa --force

# Verify installation
ansible-galaxy collection list | grep freeipa
Issue 3: Playbook Execution Failures
Problem: Tasks fail due to existing resources

Solution:

# Add error handling to playbooks
# Use 'failed_when: false' for non-critical tasks
# Use 'ignore_errors: yes' when appropriate

# Example modification:
- name: Create user (ignore if exists)
  freeipa.ansible_freeipa.ipauser:
    # ... other parameters
    state: present
  ignore_errors: yes
Issue 4: DNS Resolution Problems
Problem: Client enrollment fails due to DNS issues

Solution:

# Update /etc/hosts on client machines
echo "192.168.1.10 idm-server.example.com" >> /etc/hosts

# Or configure proper DNS forwarding
# Add to IdM server DNS configuration
